# Response headers for atlas.bumelerze.com (Cloudflare Pages reads this file
# from the published root; scripts/assemble_site.sh copies it there).
# - CORS open to every origin: the app, the website and anyone else fetch the
#   products directly by URL (GitHub Pages sent the same header).
# - No Cache-Control here on purpose: Pages' default (revalidate, 304 when
#   unchanged) shows a revised product or a new index at once.
# - HSTS for a year; the files are data (JSON, PDF, Parquet), never framed.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
